C1  Lambda_late before/after the shift: kappa*rho_vlate + lambda  ->  kappa*rho_vlate + lambda ; difference = 0
    IE: R = rho_tot - C ; under rho_tot -> rho_tot + c at fixed reader datum: Lambda_late = R - (rho_tot - rho_vlate) -> -C + c + rho_vlate
    i.e. the shift moves the datum C -> C + c (free translation); no value of C is a fixed point.
